/T (MEDVICE Insight is our proprietary software designed for strong clinical engineering practices. It centralises medical equipment inventories, and it features a closed-loop work order process to track equipment service and expense data from acquisition to retirement. The software can be customised to report data that is important to you, so that you can better identify areas for cost)
/E (MEDVICE Insight is our proprietary software designed for strong clinical engineering practices. It centralises medical equipment inventories, and it features a closed-loop work order process to track equipment service and expense data from acquisition to retirement. The software can be customised to report data that is important to you, so that you can better identify areas for cost)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
