523 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 418 0 R
/T (This user-friendly system incorporates four major modules that help manage all clinical engineering activities in one place. It includes robust interfaces for asset and service management, as well as a centralized location to communicate and source parts requests. The reporting and analytics features allow multiple users within an organization to customize their own dashboards that highlight key performance indicators that are most relevant to them, and the advanced reporting feature can generate more detailed reports for regulatory compliance or hospital leadership. Even more, the software can be integrated with multiple existing hospital systems, such as ERP and HRIS, and it is also designed to be used in all-sized organizations, from single departments to multi-facility hospital systems. A software demonstration is available upon request.)
/E (This user-friendly system incorporates four major modules that help manage all clinical engineering activities in one place. It includes robust interfaces for asset and service management, as well as a centralized location to communicate and source parts requests. The reporting and analytics features allow multiple users within an organization to customize their own dashboards that highlight key performance indicators that are most relevant to them, and the advanced reporting feature can generate more detailed reports for regulatory compliance or hospital leadership. Even more, the software can be integrated with multiple existing hospital systems, such as ERP and HRIS, and it is also designed to be used in all-sized organizations, from single departments to multi-facility hospital systems. A software demonstration is available upon request.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
